2026-07-27T07:52:04.8721107Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T07:52:04.8781940Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:52:04.8782467Z i /tmp/RtmpmrXCkK/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:52:04.8782820Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:52:04.8783246Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:52:04.8784034Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:52:04.8784618Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:52:04.8785866Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:52:04.8786539Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:52:04.9010104Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:52:04.9116977Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:52:04.9525527Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:52:04.9672886Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
